[{"id":3919267193,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7pm0V5","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"As I've mentioned in the proposal, I am not opposed to implementing this, but I feel more improvements are necessary\r\n \r\n- Regarding SyncMode naming, it should use \"Independent\" instead of \"Discrete\", and \"Phase\" or \"Cyclic\" instead of \"Continuous\"\r\n- Performing division every frame is costly, so I believe we need to cache the divided values per point and perform simple addition instead. You can refer AnimatedSprite time progression process\r\n- In addition to runtime warnings, clearer preventive measures are needed, such as displaying a popup warning in the Animation Tree Editor (similar to the Animation Player's ReadOnly warning) or marking points with \"×\" if the point is **not** AnimationNodeAnimation (We cannot guarantee that they are finite and immutable in length except for AnimationNodeAnimation)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"537\" height=\"322\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47fae73d-f405-4cc2-9cd7-3bfedd5c154a\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"91\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/19df5598-1da9-40ee-8bfc-9508ae1f414f\" />","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117275#pullrequestreview-3919267193","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117275","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-10T02:15:32Z"},{"id":3919950705,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7ppbNx","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117275#pullrequestreview-3919950705","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117275","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-10T06:13:00Z"},{"id":3920107381,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7pqBd1","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117275#pullrequestreview-3920107381","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117275","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-10T06:35:36Z"},{"id":3924793478,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7p75iG","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117275#pullrequestreview-3924793478","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117275","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-10T19:21:58Z"},{"id":3925271508,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7p9uPU","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?u=81ff9417b54ba7cb18e202e7f83c1cd7dcaa5888&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","login":"uno1982","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117275#pullrequestreview-3925271508","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117275","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-10T20:36:31Z"},{"id":3948068512,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7rUr6g","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","commit_id":"dddb0e777ca0a5b9dc78ae81a528a77680c2dc22","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"I found two critical issues\r\n\r\n1. If the Cyclic mode includes anything other than NodeAnimation, it should not be processed in the first place. Since extra case statements are required for items that cannot be processed correctly, the entire process should be aborted\r\n2. Discrete mode is not supported correctly\r\n\r\nI’ve uploaded a patch that addresses these issues partially. Regarding Discrete mode, I’ve only fixed BlendSpace2D, so after applying the patch, please apply the fix to BlendSpace1D as well.\r\n\r\n[0001-Refactor-blending-code-modify-warning-on-BSEditor.patch](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25990117/0001-Refactor-blending-code-modify-warning-on-BSEditor.patch)\r\n\r\nAlso, I’ve made the following changes to the GUI. Simply displaying “No sync” isn’t very helpful because it doesn’t convey the reason to the user. Instead, it should indicate that the point itself is invalid and completely abort the process. I have commented out the implementation for the error popup as a TODO, so please implement that.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"384\" height=\"180\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bafce6d8-9661-4daf-bbe6-c8d8d3b2a479\" />\r\n\r\nFurthermore, your current implementation handles seek operations, but I believe we need to test it a bit more to ensure it works correctly. Since your current code is inconsistent with the TimeScale node, if you plan to support seek, I think you should submit a separate follow-up PR to implement additional options alongside NodeTimeScale, rather than including it in this PR.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117275#pullrequestreview-3948068512","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117275","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-14T04:15:45Z"},{"id":3949421382,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7rZ2NG","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/